{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49629","headline":"定风波 二 · 李珣","name":"定风波 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载逍遥物外居，白云流水似相於。\n乘兴有时携短櫂，江岛，谁知求道不求鱼。\n到处等闲邀鹤伴，春岸，野花香气扑琴书。\n更饮一杯红霞酒，回首，半钩新月贴清虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}